<% content_for :seo_title, t('seo.about.title') %>
<% content_for :seo_description, t('seo.about.description') %>
<% content_for :seo_keywords, t('seo.about.keywords') %>

<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <% if I18n.locale == :fr %>
    <header class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300">A propos — Tube'NPlay</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mt-3 mb-4">
        Tube'NPlay: la decouverte musicale qui devient un jeu
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg">
        Tube'NPlay transforme la decouverte musicale en experience interactive: tu swipes, tu joues, tu decouvres et tu peux gagner des recompenses reelles.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">Mon histoire</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Je viens de la culture hip-hop et de la scene. Choregraphies sur Run DMC, energie des battles DJ, cassettes qui tournent, CD chines a la Fnac et chez Virgin: la musique m'a construit.</p>
          <p>A 20 ans, c'est l'ere Naughty By Nature, N.W.A, 2Pac, Snoop Doggy Dog. Puis le streaming bouleverse tout: plus accessible, mais souvent moins humain dans la decouverte.</p>
          <p>J'explore jazz, funk, soul, rock, jungle, EDM, reggae avec la meme obsession: vivre la musique, pas seulement la consommer.</p>
          <p>En 2018, je cree The Jam Quizz. En 2025, apres ma formation web, je lance Tube'NPlay pour reunir jeu, decouverte et visibilite des artistes emergents.</p>
          <p>Tube'NPlay, c'est la suite logique d'une vie dediee a la musique.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 max-w-md">
          <div class="bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-700 bg-black" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;">
              <%= image_tag "about/photo_moi.jpg",
                alt: "Photo du fondateur Tube'NPlay",
                class: "w-full h-full object-cover" %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Le concept</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Tube'NPlay transforme la decouverte musicale en experience interactive.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-3">
          Tu swipes, tu joues, tu decouvres... et tu peux meme gagner des recompenses reelles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Pour les artistes</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Tube'NPlay offre un nouveau canal de visibilite, simple et equitable.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>• Mise en avant immediate aupres de vrais fans</li>
          <li>• Decouverte sans algorithmes qui favorisent les plus gros profils</li>
          <li>• Playlists dediees a ton univers</li>
          <li>• Engagement reel: likes, swipes, favoris</li>
          <li>• Signaux utiles pour mieux comprendre ton audience</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          Une maniere moderne et fun de te faire connaitre.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-700 bg-black" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;">
            <%= image_tag "about/for_artists.jpg",
              alt: "Tube'NPlay pour les artistes",
              class: "w-full h-full object-cover" %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Pour les fans</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Tube'NPlay rend la decouverte musicale plus fun que jamais.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>• Decouvrir des artistes indes avant tout le monde</li>
          <li>• Jouer avec la musique via le swipe</li>
          <li>• Gagner des points, badges et recompenses reelles</li>
          <li>• Participer a des classements et defis</li>
          <li>• Sortir des recommandations repetitives</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          La musique devient un jeu... avec de vrais gains.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-700 bg-black" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;">
            <%= image_tag "about/Superfan_Feature.jpg",
              alt: "Tube'NPlay pour les fans",
              class: "w-full h-full object-cover" %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Notre mission</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Creer un espace ou les artistes emergents gagnent en visibilite.</p>
          <p>Et ou les fans decouvrent la musique autrement: en jouant, en explorant, en gagnant.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <%= link_to "Explorer les playlists", playlists_path, class: "bg-purple-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 transition-colors" %>
      <%= link_to "Lire le blog", blog_path, class: "bg-gray-800 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors" %>
      <%= link_to "Nous contacter", contact_path, class: "border border-purple-500 text-purple-300 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 hover:text-white transition-colors" %>
    </div>
  <% else %>
    <header class="mb-10">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-300">About — Tube'NPlay</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mt-3 mb-4">
        Tube'NPlay: music discovery turned into a game
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg">
        Tube'NPlay turns music discovery into an interactive experience: swipe, play, discover, and unlock real rewards.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">My story</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>I come from hip-hop culture and live energy. Run DMC choreographies, DJ battles, tapes on repeat, and CDs from Fnac and Virgin shaped my relationship with music.</p>
          <p>At 20, it was Naughty By Nature, N.W.A, 2Pac and Snoop Doggy Dog. Then streaming changed everything: more access, but often less emotional discovery.</p>
          <p>I moved through jazz, funk, soul, rock, jungle, EDM and reggae with one goal: keep discovery alive and personal.</p>
          <p>In 2018, I launched The Jam Quizz. In 2025, after web development training, I launched Tube'NPlay to connect gaming, discovery and artist visibility.</p>
          <p>Tube'NPlay is the natural continuation of a life dedicated to music.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 max-w-md">
          <div class="bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-4">
            <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-700 bg-black" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;">
              <%= image_tag "about/photo_moi.jpg",
                alt: "Tube'NPlay founder photo",
                class: "w-full h-full object-cover" %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">The concept</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Tube'NPlay turns music discovery into an interactive experience.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-3">
          Swipe, play, discover... and unlock real-world rewards.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">For artists</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Tube'NPlay offers a modern and fair visibility channel.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>• Immediate exposure to real fans</li>
          <li>• Discovery beyond algorithm-heavy ranking systems</li>
          <li>• Playlists matched to each artist identity</li>
          <li>• Real engagement: likes, swipes, favorites</li>
          <li>• Useful audience signals to improve strategy</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          A fun and effective way to get discovered.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-700 bg-black" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;">
            <%= image_tag "about/for_artists.jpg",
              alt: "Tube'NPlay for artists",
              class: "w-full h-full object-cover" %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">For fans</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Tube'NPlay makes discovery more exciting than ever.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li>• Discover indie artists before everyone else</li>
          <li>• Play with music through swipe interactions</li>
          <li>• Earn points, badges and real rewards</li>
          <li>• Join rankings and challenges</li>
          <li>• Escape repetitive recommendations</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          Music becomes a game, with real gains.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg p-4">
          <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-700 bg-black" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;">
            <%= image_tag "about/Superfan_Feature.jpg",
              alt: "Tube'NPlay for fans",
              class: "w-full h-full object-cover" %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Our mission</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Create a space where emerging artists gain visibility.</p>
          <p>And where fans discover music differently: by playing, exploring and winning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <%= link_to "Explore playlists", playlists_path, class: "bg-purple-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 transition-colors" %>
      <%= link_to "Read the blog", blog_path, class: "bg-gray-800 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors" %>
      <%= link_to "Contact us", contact_path, class: "border border-purple-500 text-purple-300 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-purple-500 hover:text-white transition-colors" %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</section>
